WEBVTT

00:03.600 --> 00:05.600
You must've noticed.

00:05.600 --> 00:07.610
That boy is a monster.

00:09.020 --> 00:10.460
A monster?

00:10.940 --> 00:12.980
You can see it. I know you can.

00:14.260 --> 00:17.770
The elementals all refuse to get near him.

00:17.770 --> 00:20.690
It's not that they don't get close to him
because he has no magical power.

00:20.690 --> 00:21.920
They're avoiding him.

00:22.750 --> 00:26.670
In the same way they avoid a demon's miasma.

00:26.670 --> 00:31.920
T-True, Seika's a little odd, but he's human!

00:32.370 --> 00:34.050
How can you be sure?

00:34.410 --> 00:37.870
I grew up with Seika in the same mansion.

00:37.870 --> 00:39.760
I've known him since he was little.

00:40.000 --> 00:45.480
Are his parents really 
Count Lamprogue and his wife?

00:46.370 --> 00:47.430
No...

00:47.430 --> 00:49.720
His father is the count,

00:49.720 --> 00:51.320
but I don't know who his mother is.

00:51.770 --> 00:55.270
Then how can you be sure she isn't a demon?

00:55.270 --> 00:55.950
But I...

00:56.280 --> 00:59.440
I believe Seika's human!

00:59.440 --> 01:02.620
Believing means refusing to think.

01:03.480 --> 01:07.180
Yifa, you should get away 
from your dangerous master.

01:10.110 --> 01:13.350
For now, why don't you 
start by touring the harem?

01:32.230 --> 01:43.320
<b>The Reincarnation of
the Strongest Exorcist in Another World</b>

02:49.800 --> 02:51.120
Thanks for the ride.

02:51.120 --> 02:52.260
You can go back.

02:57.760 --> 02:58.510
Hey there.

03:19.820 --> 03:21.800
Very scary.

03:24.560 --> 03:27.570
Summoning. Konaki-Jijii.

03:35.230 --> 03:36.440
Heavy, isn't he?

03:37.620 --> 03:40.170
No, no. Stay put.

03:40.170 --> 03:40.860
Phase of earth.

03:41.460 --> 03:42.740
Spell of Asbestos Net.

03:49.620 --> 03:54.490
Couldn't you have just caught it with 
this instead of using an ayakashi?

03:54.490 --> 03:57.590
It would be dangerous for it if it 
lost the use of its wings in mid-air.

03:57.590 --> 04:02.190
It's rare for you to show any 
mercy to such a creature...

04:02.190 --> 04:03.180
Yeah?

04:03.800 --> 04:06.560
Seika, is that...

04:06.560 --> 04:07.510
Yup.

04:10.640 --> 04:13.190
This creature is male, right?

04:13.190 --> 04:16.080
Does that mean it has a partner, then?

04:16.080 --> 04:18.080
No, it doesn't.

04:18.080 --> 04:20.490
This dragon changed from male to female.

04:21.580 --> 04:25.720
Many fish can change their sex 
in response to their environment.

04:25.720 --> 04:30.870
The dragon probably did the same
at some point after its partner died.

04:31.350 --> 04:35.120
And it's not at all rare for creatures to 
be able to reproduce with just females.

04:35.120 --> 04:36.570
Snakes and lizards do it.

04:36.570 --> 04:38.040
They do?

04:38.300 --> 04:40.680
Now, what to do with this?

04:41.730 --> 04:42.740
I know!

04:43.420 --> 04:48.180
Once in a while you need to change which 
end of the egg points up, like this...

04:48.750 --> 04:52.680
That story about an Astiria princess 
hatching the dragon from an egg

04:52.680 --> 04:54.860
is starting to seem more plausible.

05:02.740 --> 05:07.000
Astiria's harem is more than a place 
for the king's wives and mistresses

05:07.000 --> 05:10.910
to spend their time in complicated 
power struggles against each other.

05:10.910 --> 05:17.210
There are many instructors here. 
In a way, it's like an academy.

05:17.210 --> 05:20.230
Many of the girls here will be involved
in the politics of this nation,

05:20.230 --> 05:23.120
so it's also a way to train 
female government officials.

05:23.120 --> 05:27.400
But most of the country's queens 
have also come from here.

05:27.400 --> 05:30.090
In that sense, this place 
is without doubt, a harem.

05:30.630 --> 05:34.010
It's clear that the prince 
is in love with you.

05:34.010 --> 05:36.650
Well? Interesting place, isn't it?

05:36.650 --> 05:40.320
If nothing else, I'm sure it's very 
different than what you imagined.

05:40.320 --> 05:41.070
Yeah.

05:41.380 --> 05:47.080
The current Queen of Astiria, 
the prince's mother, is a superlative ruler.

05:47.080 --> 05:50.700
Wise, decisive, and loved by the people.

05:51.100 --> 05:56.780
The prince is worried that he won't live up 
to the legacy she'll leave behind.

05:58.070 --> 06:01.480
That's why he's in such a hurry to win 
glory for himself with the dragon matter.

06:01.480 --> 06:03.840
And why he's in such a hurry to find a wife.

06:03.840 --> 06:07.260
He's a young boy. Very inexperienced 
in the ways of the world.

06:07.260 --> 06:10.200
But he's not a bad person.

06:10.200 --> 06:13.930
I've known him since he was a baby at 
his mother's breast, and I guarantee it.

06:13.930 --> 06:17.590
Would you stay by his side, and support him?

06:22.930 --> 06:24.370
I'm tired...

06:24.370 --> 06:30.320
Sheesh. This creature's got some nerve, 
making you take care of its egg!

06:32.160 --> 06:35.580
It's hard to heat up these rocks by myself.

06:35.580 --> 06:38.020
What will you do next?

06:38.020 --> 06:39.850
It's time I head back.

06:39.850 --> 06:42.750
I need to tell the prince there's no danger.

06:42.750 --> 06:45.440
Hey, I'm leaving.

06:47.170 --> 06:49.150
Don't growl at me.

06:50.060 --> 06:51.090
Hey, hey!

06:52.200 --> 06:54.470
When is it going to let me go?

06:55.120 --> 06:58.950
It's going to be a while, 
from the look of it.

06:58.950 --> 07:00.510
Oh, dear.

07:05.420 --> 07:06.780
That's true.

07:08.000 --> 07:11.030
Hey, what did you think of the harem?

07:11.030 --> 07:12.980
Did you like it?

07:13.590 --> 07:14.830
Well...

07:14.830 --> 07:17.680
I was just waiting for you.

07:17.680 --> 07:19.860
Gould, this is her.

07:20.870 --> 07:24.250
Oh, my, she's quite pretty.

07:24.480 --> 07:27.560
You said she's done some studies, right?

07:27.560 --> 07:29.740
And can use magic?

07:29.740 --> 07:30.770
Yes.

07:30.770 --> 07:33.930
It's hard to put a price on her,

07:35.700 --> 07:37.710
but this seems reasonable.

07:37.710 --> 07:38.940
Good.

07:38.940 --> 07:42.820
Curtis, this counts as an 
official appraisal, right?

07:42.820 --> 07:43.940
Yes, my prince.

07:44.530 --> 07:48.040
The liberation tax is 1/20th the price.

07:48.040 --> 07:49.080
All right.

07:49.080 --> 07:49.610
Come here!

07:50.130 --> 07:54.700
U-Um, what is this?

07:55.120 --> 07:57.780
The paperwork to liberate you!

07:58.180 --> 08:00.120
From today on, you're free!

08:00.330 --> 08:04.540
Normally you have to do this at 
an official government office,

08:04.540 --> 08:07.070
but it's okay because I'm recognizing it.

08:07.070 --> 08:10.760
And I'll pay all the money to liberate you.

08:10.760 --> 08:13.130
Y-You can't do that!

08:13.130 --> 08:16.510
You need Seika's approval to free me!

08:16.770 --> 08:18.310
He'll approve it.

08:18.310 --> 08:21.890
He's not going to say no 
if he's paid enough, is he?

08:21.890 --> 08:25.190
And if he refuses to free you,

08:25.560 --> 08:29.210
I'll issue an order to conscript 
all slaves in Protoaster,

08:29.210 --> 08:32.070
and force him to sell you to me!

08:32.800 --> 08:33.350
I—

08:33.350 --> 08:35.310
I heard what Lize said.

08:36.660 --> 08:40.480
I don't understand what 
makes Seika dangerous,

08:40.480 --> 08:43.870
but I can't let you stay 
with a dangerous master.

08:44.840 --> 08:48.660
And Seika said he'd respect your opinion.

08:48.660 --> 08:52.210
N-No! I don't want to be freed!

08:52.450 --> 08:53.570
Why not?

08:53.570 --> 08:57.170
Being a slave means someone else 
has power over your entire life!

08:57.170 --> 09:00.310
I-I'll decide for myself what I want to do.

09:00.310 --> 09:02.520
I may not be free in status...

09:02.520 --> 09:05.730
but I'm free to decide what I want!

09:07.080 --> 09:09.150
The paperwork is ready.

09:09.150 --> 09:11.920
Have the slave put her thumbprint here.

09:11.920 --> 09:14.150
But she says she doesn't want to...

09:14.150 --> 09:17.410
She'll realize she was wrong someday.

09:17.410 --> 09:22.330
For now, I believe you should force her 
to accept it, even if she doesn't want to.

09:24.660 --> 09:26.220
Oh...

09:26.220 --> 09:28.630
I'm sorry, Yifa. Guards!

09:30.130 --> 09:32.170
N-No! Stop!

09:32.170 --> 09:32.800
Or...

09:32.800 --> 09:33.590
Don't.

09:35.800 --> 09:40.220
If you use your power here, this will 
cease to be simply your own problem.

09:40.220 --> 09:44.220
Not that you could do anything 
inside my sacred grounds.

09:44.800 --> 09:46.140
Why...?

09:46.360 --> 09:47.350
Forgive me.

09:47.350 --> 09:51.650
This is what's best for 
my country, and you, too.

09:55.730 --> 09:58.220
Blood will serve as ink for 
the thumbprint, correct?

09:58.220 --> 09:59.950
You know the laws well, Lize.

10:02.060 --> 10:03.460
<i>Seika!</i>

10:13.360 --> 10:14.960
Sorry for interrupting!

10:15.600 --> 10:18.160
I'm back, everyone!

10:18.160 --> 10:20.640
Sorry I've returned in such 
a fashion, but I was in a hurry!

10:23.930 --> 10:27.630
Put simply, I've made 
friends with the dragon!

10:27.630 --> 10:31.970
Now it lets me ride on its back!

10:31.970 --> 10:33.020
Oh, right!

10:33.440 --> 10:35.940
Can someone come with me?

10:36.360 --> 10:41.510
I want to keep its egg warm, so I could 
really use somebody who can use fire magic!

10:42.650 --> 10:43.910
Yifa,

10:44.750 --> 10:46.120
come with me!

10:49.690 --> 10:50.480
Okay!

10:51.340 --> 10:52.040
Don't go!

10:54.160 --> 10:55.490
I'm sorry.

10:55.490 --> 10:58.470
I'm going with Seika after all.

10:59.600 --> 11:01.900
I really like him!

11:04.030 --> 11:04.960
Yifa!

11:12.490 --> 11:14.280
Wow, we're flying!

11:14.720 --> 11:16.270
Like a dragon knight, huh?

11:16.270 --> 11:18.290
You're amazing, Seika!

11:18.290 --> 11:20.770
I never thought I'd get to 
ride on the back of a dragon!

11:20.770 --> 11:23.700
I didn't think it was possible, either, 
until just a little while ago.

11:24.310 --> 11:27.080
Um, thanks for what you did earlier.

11:27.080 --> 11:28.540
For what?

11:29.990 --> 11:31.120
Never mind.

11:32.800 --> 11:34.790
Hang on tight!

11:40.920 --> 11:43.150
Is this its nest?

11:43.150 --> 11:44.220
Yup.

11:44.220 --> 11:46.480
The rocks over there are where it sleeps.

11:46.480 --> 11:47.780
The egg's there, too.

11:47.780 --> 11:48.850
Egg?

11:49.650 --> 11:50.520
You see...

11:55.220 --> 11:56.020
<i>Phase of earth.</i>

11:57.230 --> 11:59.030
<i>Spell of Transparent Fortress.</i>

11:59.760 --> 12:01.190
Isn't that monster...

12:01.840 --> 12:03.650
Stop hiding and come out.

12:06.480 --> 12:07.540
You wanted the dragon.

12:07.540 --> 12:10.660
No... it was the egg from the start?

12:12.000 --> 12:13.010
Zekt.

12:13.010 --> 12:17.090
I was planning on getting the heck 
out of here the second I was done.

12:17.370 --> 12:19.740
I didn't expect to see you here, though.

12:21.070 --> 12:23.510
I'm afraid you'll have to die.

12:24.570 --> 12:28.010
That dumbass prince believed 
the lies I told him!

12:28.010 --> 12:29.850
What a fool.

12:30.970 --> 12:35.880
Oh, you think your pathetic 
magic can help you, do you?

12:36.650 --> 12:39.520
He'll burn you to a crisp 
and swallow you whole!

12:54.620 --> 12:57.200
Damn it! What was that spell?

12:57.200 --> 12:59.950
Are you with that elf?

13:00.980 --> 13:03.670
I'm not going to just stand 
there helpless anymore.

13:04.010 --> 13:05.340
<i>Yifa...</i>

13:06.710 --> 13:08.930
I'm not done yet!

13:09.330 --> 13:11.060
Lava tiger!

13:11.060 --> 13:14.370
Go earn the money I paid you assholes!

13:17.560 --> 13:18.860
Phase of sun and fire.

13:19.200 --> 13:21.020
Spell of White Flames.

13:30.620 --> 13:33.090
I did say I'd blast it to ash.

13:33.090 --> 13:34.790
But I guess there isn't any ash left.

13:34.790 --> 13:36.750
Who are you?

13:37.740 --> 13:40.140
The world's strongest sorcerer.

13:41.280 --> 13:43.920
What are you talking about?!

13:43.920 --> 13:46.590
D-Don't just stand there!

13:46.590 --> 13:48.470
Go get them!

13:55.490 --> 13:57.600
Don't run away, damn it!

13:57.600 --> 14:01.110
Yeah. Nobody's running away.

14:01.110 --> 14:02.720
You think you can mess with me?

14:02.720 --> 14:05.690
I'll blow up this whole mountain!

14:09.320 --> 14:13.280
My spellbook!

14:14.140 --> 14:16.320
Well done, Yifa.

14:16.320 --> 14:19.750
Well, you did tell me to take action.

14:19.750 --> 14:23.530
I knew I was right to bring you here.

14:23.530 --> 14:26.770
I didn't know you'd learned 
to use water magic like that!

14:26.770 --> 14:27.920
You're amazing!

14:33.100 --> 14:36.960
They were lying to me?

14:36.960 --> 14:37.480
Yes.

14:39.650 --> 14:41.100
I'll deal with this later.

14:41.100 --> 14:42.770
Keep them in prison until then.

14:45.690 --> 14:48.200
What about my spellbook?

14:50.220 --> 14:53.410
Seika, tell me what you've learned.

14:53.840 --> 14:57.680
The dragon was acting oddly 
because it had laid an egg.

14:57.680 --> 15:02.880
The dragon accepted me because 
I helped it raise its egg.

15:03.240 --> 15:07.130
That makes me believe
the story about the queen

15:07.130 --> 15:09.590
who hatched the dragon from an egg was true.

15:09.910 --> 15:13.430
To the dragon, humans were its parents.

15:13.430 --> 15:15.810
And that was true for its children, as well.

15:16.690 --> 15:21.400
That's why they kept the capital 
safe for so many centuries.

15:21.400 --> 15:24.030
Please repay the favor, my prince.

15:25.290 --> 15:31.280
Help it hatch its egg and the dragon and the 
people of Protoaster can be a family once more.

15:32.840 --> 15:33.700
No.

15:34.350 --> 15:35.370
Why not?

15:35.370 --> 15:39.790
I can't persuade the 
Imperial Diet without anything concrete.

15:40.720 --> 15:44.670
So, Seika... 
would you please kill the dragon?

15:44.670 --> 15:50.110
I know! If you can go into 
its nest, you can poison it!

15:50.110 --> 15:51.760
What are you talking about?

15:52.800 --> 15:54.520
You don't understand!

15:54.520 --> 15:58.430
I'm the crown prince! 
I need to achieve something here!

15:58.680 --> 16:03.770
If I can't solve this myself, 
I can't be the next king!

16:03.770 --> 16:05.160
So please!

16:05.160 --> 16:06.640
I refuse.

16:08.010 --> 16:09.270
You do, then?

16:09.750 --> 16:10.610
Men!

16:12.720 --> 16:16.840
On suspicion of using magic to cause 
the Astirian dragon to behave erratically,

16:17.440 --> 16:19.450
I'm placing you under arrest.

16:20.720 --> 16:23.720
<i>I guess I should play along here.</i>

16:23.720 --> 16:25.580
Yifa, come here.

16:26.420 --> 16:28.090
You're free.

16:28.400 --> 16:31.100
You don't need to stay with 
your suspicious master.

16:31.910 --> 16:35.510
I'll give you the right to 
be a citizen in Astiria!

16:35.510 --> 16:37.300
<i>You're kidding me!</i>

16:37.300 --> 16:39.260
Now, come here.

16:39.850 --> 16:41.640
It's dangerous there...

16:43.770 --> 16:45.440
Enough!

16:45.440 --> 16:49.440
I've put up with all this nonsense because 
this politics has nothing to do with my country.

16:49.760 --> 16:51.620
But you were just after Yifa?

16:51.620 --> 16:53.780
How can you face your men 
and your people like that?

16:54.550 --> 16:56.800
You're not even trying 
to solve this properly!

16:56.800 --> 16:58.740
Don't try to make others
do it all for you!

16:58.740 --> 17:02.410
Before you start thinking about glory 
and women, think about doing your job,

17:02.790 --> 17:03.830
you little child!

17:04.240 --> 17:05.790
Little child?

17:06.090 --> 17:07.240
I can't...

17:07.670 --> 17:11.380
I can't give Yifa to someone like you!

17:15.020 --> 17:17.260
<i>Crap. I overdid it.</i>

17:21.520 --> 17:23.110
My apologies.

17:23.110 --> 17:25.520
Put away your swords.

17:25.520 --> 17:27.850
This farce has gone on long enough.

17:28.240 --> 17:29.120
Lize!

17:29.650 --> 17:31.520
Let's hear how Yifa feels.

17:35.360 --> 17:39.830
My prince, I'm honored, 
but I refuse your offer.

17:40.370 --> 17:43.000
I'm going back to the academy with Seika.

17:43.000 --> 17:44.000
But...

17:44.000 --> 17:47.710
Even if I was free, 
I'm not joining your harem.

17:47.710 --> 17:48.880
But...

17:49.130 --> 17:52.250
Prince, it's time to give it up.

17:52.620 --> 17:54.710
She's clearly rejected you.

17:59.200 --> 18:01.770
I apologize for the impudence, Seika.

18:01.770 --> 18:04.820
Thank you for your aid in the dragon matter.

18:04.820 --> 18:07.310
I'm happy to have learned the truth.

18:07.310 --> 18:09.520
And while I know it's a lot to ask,

18:09.520 --> 18:12.820
would you please forget 
what the prince just said?

18:12.820 --> 18:13.800
Of course.

18:13.800 --> 18:16.870
I got a little heated, too...

18:17.320 --> 18:21.010
By the way, I'd like to 
talk to Yifa in private...

18:24.400 --> 18:27.280
You love the boy, don't you?

18:27.280 --> 18:28.330
L-Love him?

18:28.670 --> 18:31.330
Then, there's nothing more to discuss.

18:32.000 --> 18:33.250
Put out your hand.

18:35.170 --> 18:37.900
I'll give you a few of my elementals.

18:39.450 --> 18:41.670
The light ones are especially rare.

18:42.290 --> 18:43.770
They can heal.

18:47.000 --> 18:51.700
Looking at you reminds me of the 
elf princess in the fairy tales.

18:51.700 --> 18:55.200
A girl of such great compassion who, 
despite being in the hero's party,

18:55.200 --> 18:56.400
took pity on the demon king.

18:57.130 --> 18:59.110
I'm sure he will recognize your feelings.

19:01.500 --> 19:04.160
May you find happiness, my comrade.

19:07.540 --> 19:10.040
Episode 9:
Yifa's Resolve

19:56.990 --> 20:01.020
So you could use elemental magic because 
you're a descendant of the elves.

20:01.020 --> 20:03.590
Yeah. I had no idea.

20:03.590 --> 20:07.680
Maybe my mom knew.

20:08.070 --> 20:10.770
That boy is a monster.

20:11.630 --> 20:13.440
Um, Seika...

20:15.920 --> 20:17.970
No, nothing.

20:18.750 --> 20:22.780
I'm glad you rejected that loser prince.

20:23.690 --> 20:27.120
Oh, hey, if you were to get married, 
who would you like to get married to?

20:28.400 --> 20:32.080
Um... It wouldn't matter 
who their parents were,

20:32.080 --> 20:35.920
but I'd want them to be smarter 
than me, and strong, and kind,

20:35.920 --> 20:40.380
and maybe somebody who gets a little 
lonely without someone around.

20:41.320 --> 20:43.420
That's a lot.

20:43.420 --> 20:46.530
This is going to sound arrogant, 
but it's important to compromise.

20:46.530 --> 20:49.060
Or else you'll never find the 
person you're looking for.

20:51.860 --> 20:53.530
That's not true.

21:05.280 --> 21:07.910
Weak! So weak!

21:07.910 --> 21:10.830
<b>Muderev</b>

21:16.120 --> 21:19.130
<b>Pyrslaria</b>

21:19.130 --> 21:21.300
You're going to hurt me?

21:21.300 --> 21:24.050
I want to be friends!

21:26.680 --> 21:28.180
Good!

21:28.950 --> 21:31.190
Now feed him.

21:32.270 --> 21:35.230
<b>Lo Ni</b>

21:39.710 --> 21:41.690
I missed!

21:41.690 --> 21:44.650
<b>Gull Ganis</b>

21:44.650 --> 21:47.570
Damn it! Hit!

21:51.330 --> 21:54.410
My monster trap was defeated so easily...?

21:54.730 --> 21:56.820
Wh-Who are you people?

21:57.330 --> 22:00.750
I told you I'd spare your life 
if you showed us the way.

22:00.750 --> 22:04.490
How can I believe you after you 
killed everyone in the village?!

22:06.600 --> 22:07.570
Yes!

22:07.570 --> 22:10.470
I managed to summon that huge thing!

22:14.310 --> 22:15.810
<b>Elder Cyclops</b>

22:16.430 --> 22:18.060
I'll deal with him.

22:29.060 --> 22:30.650
Dispel Circle.

22:39.500 --> 22:42.100
As unflappable as ever!

22:42.100 --> 22:43.870
And beautiful swordplay, too!

22:43.870 --> 22:47.040
Of course! The captain's a divine being!

22:47.040 --> 22:50.680
And his eyes see all.

22:50.680 --> 22:53.680
No... no, impossible!

22:54.650 --> 22:58.940
If you're just going to 
kill him, let me eat him.

22:58.940 --> 23:00.270
No fair!

23:00.270 --> 23:02.650
I want to feed him to Meede!

23:02.650 --> 23:04.360
I don't need him.

23:04.360 --> 23:06.110
I'm so full...

23:06.110 --> 23:08.030
Then, it's settled.

23:08.030 --> 23:10.340
Those who want him, divide him up evenly.

23:14.320 --> 23:17.830
<i>A problem occurred, 
but it was nothing unexpected.</i>

23:18.090 --> 23:21.750
<i>I must fulfill this great task, 
no matter what!</i>

23:22.400 --> 23:26.900
<i>I must defeat the hero, 
even if it costs me my life!</i>

23:29.430 --> 23:31.180
What is it, Seika?

23:32.870 --> 23:34.710
No, it's nothing.

23:36.490 --> 23:39.100
There's no problem. None at all.
